						thereunder.</div><div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;margin-left: 2.5em;">(B) Annuity payments shall commence as follows:</div><div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;margin-left: 4em;">(i) If the spouse is the sole beneficiary, not later than December 31 of the later of the calendar year in which the participant would have attained the age at which the Internal Revenue Code of 1986 requires a distribution of benefits or the calendar year following the calendar year of the participant’s death.</div><div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;margin-left: 4em;">(ii) If the spouse is not the sole beneficiary, not later than December 31 of the calendar year following the calendar year of the participant’s death.</div><div style="margin:0 0 1em 0;">(d) If a person becomes entitled to a distribution from the plan under this part that constitutes an eligible rollover distribution within the
